🚀 AFTER DOWNLOAD — RUN THE MODEL

Go back to llama.cpp build folder:

cd ~/PROJECTS/ai_trial/llama.cpp/build


Run using GPU:

./bin/llama-cli \
  --model ~/MODELS/mistral/mistral-7b-instruct-v0.2.Q4_K_M.gguf \
  --ctx-size 4096 \
  --gpu-layers 999 \
  --batch-size 256 \
  --threads 8


Expected output:

using CUDA device 0: NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060
...
>


The > symbol is your prompt — type ka na ng question.

🧠 OPTIONAL: Filipino-friendly prompt

Minsan gusto mo Tagalog-friendly behavior, so you can start with:

You are a helpful Filipino assistant. Sagutin mo ako sa Tagalog or Taglish depende sa context.

